# The net's newsgroups, one per line: NAME [FLAG]. FLAG is y (posting allowed,
# the default) or n. Every station on the net must list the same groups: a
# station without a group refuses and does not relay its articles.
# Missing groups are created whenever hamnews starts (systemctl restart hamnews);
# groups are never removed from here. Remove one by hand:
#   ctlinnd rmgroup NAME   (as news: sudo -u news /usr/lib/hamnews/bin/ctlinnd ...)
